            <td class="lt-chem-38297" data-th="&Delta;G&deg;" style="text-align:center;">&gt; 0</td>
            <td class="lt-chem-38297" data-th="Comments" style="text-align:center;">Reactants are more abundant at equilibrium.</td>
        </tr>
